      "message": "Good point - better to fail here than to continue making a pipeline that simply would not be compatible with the command buffer later on. \n\nRefactored `gather_immutable_samplers` to return a bool to indicate success or failure. If it fails, `DawnGraphicsPipeline::Make` will now return an invalid pipeline which is what graphite looks for to trigger the dropping of a drawpass.",
